{"id": "c085370b-1cd7-4776-a714-2708de34e5b4", "slug": "aura-architecting-digital-frontiers", "title": "Aura - Architecting Digital Frontiers", "description": "Aura Architecting Login Section is designed for authenticating users through a focused access flow. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for authentication screens in web products.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Aura - Architecting Digital Frontiers\"\ndescription: \"Aura Architecting Login Section is designed for authenticating users through a focused access flow. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for authentication screens in web products.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  secondary: \"#050505\"\n  accent: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  background: \"#050505\"\n  surface: \"#18181B\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"DM Sans\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Aura - Architecting Digital Frontiers\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 377; favorites: 26; remixes: 10.\nTags: login, animated, webgl, threejs, input, validation, effect, security.\n## Overview\nAura Architecting Login Section is designed for authenticating users through a focused access flow. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for authentication screens in web products.\n\nX-01 X-02 X-03 Aura Frame Modules Scenarios Story Assets Support Access Architecting Frontiers for Tomorrow Designing modular environments with precision-crafted systems that evolve with your vision. Discover Framework…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Architecting Frontiers for Tomorrow.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #FFFFFF, secondary #050505, accent #FFFFFF, background #050505, surface #18181B, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse DM Sans for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Aura - Architecting Digital Frontiers</title>\n\n    <!-- Fonts -->\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin=\"\">\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@100;200;300;400&family=Inter:wght@200;300;400&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n    <!-- Tailwind -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script>\n        tailwind.config = {\n            theme: {\n                extend: {\n                    fontFamily: {\n                        sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'],\n                        'dm-sans': ['DM Sans', 'sans-serif'],\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n\n    <!-- Icons -->\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <!-- Animation Libraries -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r134/three.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"bg-[#050505] text-white font-sans antialiased min-h-screen relative overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-orange-500/30\">\n\n    <!-- WebGL Background -->\n    <canvas id=\"webgl-canvas\" class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none w-full h-full\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Framed Grid Environment: Background lines & Container bounds -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none z-0 flex justify-center overflow-hidden\">\n        <!-- Subtle Diagonal Texture -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.02]\" style=\"background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, #ffffff 0px, #ffffff 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 24px);\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Precision Grid Borders -->\n        <div class=\"w-full max-w-7xl h-full relative\">\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 bottom-0 left-0 w-px bg-white/10\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 bottom-0 left-1/4 w-px bg-white/[0.04] hidden sm:block\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 bottom-0 left-2/4 w-px bg-white/[0.04] hidden sm:block\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 bottom-0 left-3/4 w-px bg-white/[0.04] hidden sm:block\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 bottom-0 right-0 w-px bg-white/10\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Grid Coordinates Details -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-32 left-1/4 ml-4 text-xs text-white/30 font-sans tracking-widest hidden sm:block\">X-01</div>\n            <div class=\"absolute top-32 left-2/4 ml-4 text-xs text-white/30 font-sans tracking-widest hidden sm:block\">X-02</div>\n            <div class=\"absolute top-32 left-3/4 ml-4 text-xs text-white/30 font-sans tracking-widest hidden sm:block\">X-03</div>\n\n            <!-- Flow Beams -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 bottom-0 left-1/4 w-px overflow-hidden hidden sm:block\">\n                <div class=\"w-full h-[25vh] beam-1\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent, rgba(255,255,255,0.4), transparent);\"></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 bottom-0 right-1/4 w-px overflow-hidden hidden sm:block\">\n                <div class=\"w-full h-[30vh] beam-2\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent, rgba(255,255,255,0.3), transparent);\"></div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Main Structured Wrapper -->\n    <div class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col min-h-screen max-w-7xl mx-auto w-full\">\n\n        <!-- Frame 1: Navigation -->\n        <header class=\"relative w-full px-6 py-6 flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 bg-black/20 backdrop-blur-sm\">\n            <!-- Frame Corners -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-2.5 h-2.5 border-t border-l border-white/40 -translate-x-px -translate-y-px\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-2.5 h-2.5 border-t border-r border-white/40 translate-x-px -translate-y-px\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-2.5 h-2.5 border-b border-l border-white/40 -translate-x-px translate-y-px\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-2.5 h-2.5 border-b border-r border-white/40 translate-x-px translate-y-px\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Logo -->\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"flex items-center gap-3 group\">\n                <div class=\"w-5 h-5 bg-white rounded-sm rotate-45 flex items-center justify-center transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:rotate-[225deg]\">\n                    <div class=\"w-2 h-2 bg-black rounded-sm\"></div>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"text-sm font-normal tracking-tight font-sans\">Aura Frame</span>\n            </a>\n\n            <!-- Desktop Links -->\n            <div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-10 text-xs font-extralight text-white/70\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5 group font-sans\">\n                    Modules\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:alt-arrow-down-linear\" class=\"text-xs opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                </a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5 group font-sans\">\n                    Scenarios\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:alt-arrow-down-linear\" class=\"text-xs opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                </a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors font-sans\">Story</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors font-sans\">Assets</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors font-sans\">Support</a>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Login Gradient Button -->\n            <div class=\"hidden md:inline-flex relative group rounded-full\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.25), rgba(255,255,255,0.02)); padding: 1px;\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"px-6 py-2 text-xs font-extralight bg-black/60 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-full hover:bg-white/5 transition-all duration-300 font-sans\">\n                    Access\n                </a>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Mobile Menu Toggle -->\n            <button class=\"md:hidden text-white/70 hover:text-white\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:hamburger-menu-linear\" class=\"text-xl\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n            </button>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- Frame 2: Hero Section -->\n        <main class=\"relative flex-grow flex flex-col items-center justify-center px-4 pt-24 pb-32 text-center border-b border-white/10\" id=\"main-content\">\n            <!-- Frame Corners -->\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-2.5 h-2.5 border-b border-l border-white/40 -translate-x-px translate-y-px\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-2.5 h-2.5 border-b border-r border-white/40 translate-x-px translate-y-px\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Headline Mask Reveal -->\n            <div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-8 flex flex-col items-center justify-center w-full z-10\">\n                <h1 class=\"text-5xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl lg:text-8xl leading-none tracking-tight w-full font-dm-sans font-extralight flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-x-4 gap-y-2\">\n                    <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-flex\"><span class=\"inline-block translate-y-[110%] word-inner\">Architecting</span></span>\n                    <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-flex\"><span class=\"inline-block translate-y-[110%] word-inner\">Frontiers</span></span>\n                    <span class=\"w-full basis-full h-0\"></span> <!-- Forced Break -->\n                    <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-flex text-white/90\"><span class=\"inline-block translate-y-[110%] word-inner\">for</span></span>\n                    <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-flex text-white/90\"><span class=\"inline-block translate-y-[110%] word-inner\">Tomorrow</span></span>\n                </h1>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Subheadline Mask Reveal -->\n            <p class=\"max-w-lg mx-auto text-sm sm:text-base text-white/60 font-extralight leading-relaxed mb-12 font-sans z-10\" id=\"hero-sub\">\n                Designing modular environments with precision-crafted systems that evolve with your vision.\n            </p>\n\n            <!-- CTA Buttons (No intro fade, always present structure) -->\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-5 z-10\">\n                <!-- Primary Action -->\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-3.5 text-xs font-normal bg-[#F5F5F5] text-black rounded-full hover:bg-white transition-colors duration-300 shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(255,255,255,0.1)] font-sans tracking-wide\">\n                    Discover Framework\n                </a>\n\n                <!-- Secondary Action with Premium Border Gradient -->\n                <div class=\"w-full sm:w-auto relative group rounded-full\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to bottom right, rgba(255,255,255,0.3), rgba(255,255,255,0.05)); padding: 1px;\">\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-8 py-3.5 text-xs font-extralight bg-[#050505] text-white rounded-full transition-all duration-300 group-hover:bg-[#111] font-sans tracking-wide\">\n                        Initialize\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-sm group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform duration-300\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </main>\n\n        <!-- Frame 3: Logos Section -->\n        <footer class=\"relative w-full py-16 flex flex-col items-center justify-center bg-black/10 backdrop-blur-sm\">\n            <!-- Frame Corners -->\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-2.5 h-2.5 border-b border-l border-white/40 -translate-x-px translate-y-px\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-2.5 h-2.5 border-b border-r border-white/40 translate-x-px translate-y-px\"></div>\n\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-extralight text-white/40 mb-8 tracking-widest uppercase font-sans\">Empowering Visionary Brands</p>\n            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-10 md:gap-20 flex-wrap opacity-50 grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-700\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:box-linear\" class=\"text-xl\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <span class=\"text-lg font-normal tracking-tight font-sans\">Pulse</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:leaf-linear\" class=\"text-xl\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <span class=\"text-lg font-normal tracking-tight font-sans\">Vertex</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:layers-linear\" class=\"text-xl\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <span class=\"text-lg font-normal tracking-tight font-sans\">Strata</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:infinity-linear\" class=\"text-xl\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <span class=\"text-lg font-normal tracking-tight font-sans\">Nexis</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </footer>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Scripts -->\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            /* --- 1. Prepare & Execute Masked Word Reveal --- */\n            // Split subheadline into span-wrapped words for animation\n            const sub = document.getElementById('hero-sub');\n            if(sub) {\n                const words = sub.innerText.trim().split(' ');\n                sub.innerHTML = '';\n                words.forEach(word => {\n                    sub.innerHTML += `<span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-flex mr-1.5 align-top\"><span class=\"inline-block translate-y-[110%] word-inner\">${word}</span></span>`;\n                });\n            }\n\n            // Animate all words in sequence\n            gsap.to('.word-inner', {\n                y: '0%',\n                duration: 1.2,\n                stagger: 0.04,\n                ease: \"power4.out\",\n                delay: 0.1,\n                scrollTrigger: {\n                    trigger: \"#main-content\",\n                    start: \"top 80%\"\n                }\n            });\n\n            /* --- 2. Ambient Beams Animation --- */\n            gsap.fromTo('.beam-1',\n                { y: '-100%' },\n                { y: '500%', duration: 4.5, repeat: -1, ease: 'none' }\n            );\n            gsap.fromTo('.beam-2',\n                { y: '-100%' },\n                { y: '400%', duration: 6, repeat: -1, ease: 'none', delay: 2 }\n            );\n\n            /* --- 3. WebGL Interactive Background (Three.js) --- */\n            const canvas = document.getElementById('webgl-canvas');\n            const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n            const camera = new THREE.OrthographicCamera(-1, 1, 1, -1, 0, 1);\n            const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ canvas: canvas, alpha: true, antialias: false });\n\n            renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n            renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n\n            const vertexShader = `\n                varying vec2 vUv;\n                void main() {\n                    vUv = uv;\n                    gl_Position = vec4(position, 1.0);\n                }\n            `;\n\n            const fragmentShader = `\n                uniform float u_time;\n                uniform vec2 u_resolution;\n                uniform vec2 u_mouse;\n                varying vec2 vUv;\n\n                vec3 mod289(vec3 x) { return x - floor(x * (1.0 / 289.0)) * 289.0; }\n                vec2 mod289(vec2 x) { return x - floor(x * (1.0 / 289.0)) * 289.0; }\n                vec3 permute(vec3 x) { return mod289(((x*34.0)+1.0)*x); }\n                float snoise(vec2 v) {\n                    const vec4 C = vec4(0.211324865405187, 0.366025403784439, -0.577350269189626, 0.024390243902439);\n                    vec2 i  = floor(v + dot(v, C.yy) );\n                    vec2 x0 = v -   i + dot(i, C.xx);\n                    vec2 i1;\n                    i1 = (x0.x > x0.y) ? vec2(1.0, 0.0) : vec2(0.0, 1.0);\n                    vec4 x12 = x0.xyxy + C.xxzz;\n                    x12.xy -= i1;\n                    i = mod289(i);\n                    vec3 p = permute( permute( i.y + vec3(0.0, i1.y, 1.0 )) + i.x + vec3(0.0, i1.x, 1.0 ));\n                    vec3 m = max(0.5 - vec3(dot(x0,x0), dot(x12.xy,x12.xy), dot(x12.zw,x12.zw)), 0.0);\n                    m = m*m ;\n                    m = m*m ;\n                    vec3 x = 2.0 * fract(p * C.www) - 1.0;\n                    vec3 h = abs(x) - 0.5;\n                    vec3 ox = floor(x + 0.5);\n                    vec3 a0 = x - ox;\n                    m *= 1.79284291400159 - 0.85373472095314 * ( a0*a0 + h*h );\n                    vec3 g;\n                    g.x  = a0.x  * x0.x  + h.x  * x0.y;\n                    g.yz = a0.yz * x12.xz + h.yz * x12.yw;\n                    return 130.0 * dot(m, g);\n                }\n\n                void main() {\n                    vec2 st = gl_FragCoord.xy / u_resolution.xy;\n\n                    vec3 color = vec3(0.015, 0.01, 0.01);\n\n                    // Mouse-responsive glow center\n                    vec2 baseCenter = vec2(0.5, -0.2);\n                    vec2 glowCenter = mix(baseCenter, u_mouse, 0.35);\n\n                    vec2 pos = st - glowCenter;\n                    pos.x *= u_resolution.x / u_resolution.y;\n\n                    float dist = length(pos);\n\n                    float n = snoise(vec2(st.x * 2.0, st.y * 2.0 - u_time * 0.1)) * 0.1;\n                    dist += n;\n\n                    vec3 colorGlowOuter = vec3(0.15, 0.02, 0.0);\n                    vec3 colorGlowMid = vec3(0.6, 0.15, 0.0);\n                    vec3 colorGlowCore = vec3(0.8, 0.5, 0.2);\n\n                    float outerMix = smoothstep(1.3, 0.4, dist);\n                    float midMix = smoothstep(0.8, 0.2, dist);\n                    float coreMix = smoothstep(0.4, 0.0, dist);\n\n                    color = mix(color, colorGlowOuter, outerMix);\n                    color = mix(color, colorGlowMid, midMix);\n                    color = mix(color, colorGlowCore, coreMix);\n\n                    float vignette = smoothstep(1.0, 0.2, st.y);\n                    color *= mix(0.5, 1.0, vignette);\n\n                    gl_FragColor = vec4(color, 1.0);\n                }\n            `;\n\n            const uniforms = {\n                u_time: { value: 0.0 },\n                u_resolution: { value: new THREE.Vector2(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight) },\n                u_mouse: { value: new THREE.Vector2(0.5, 0.5) }\n            };\n\n            const material = new THREE.ShaderMaterial({\n                vertexShader: vertexShader,\n                fragmentShader: fragmentShader,\n                uniforms: uniforms\n            });\n\n            const geometry = new THREE.PlaneGeometry(2, 2);\n            const mesh = new THREE.Mesh(geometry, material);\n            scene.add(mesh);\n\n            // Animate time & render\n            let time = 0;\n            function animate() {\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n                time += 0.01;\n                uniforms.u_time.value = time;\n                renderer.render(scene, camera);\n            }\n            animate();\n\n            // Track mouse movements to update uniforms seamlessly\n            window.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n                gsap.to(uniforms.u_mouse.value, {\n                    x: e.clientX / window.innerWidth,\n                    y: 1.0 - (e.clientY / window.innerHeight),\n                    duration: 1.5,\n                    ease: \"power2.out\"\n                });\n            });\n\n            // Handle Resize\n            window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n                uniforms.u_resolution.value.set(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n            });\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "aura-architecting-digital-frontiers.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/aura-architecting-digital-frontiers.jpg", "source_name": "aura-architecting-digital-frontiers-DESIGN.md", "views": 1075, "forks": 58, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-04-28T16:25:04.146896+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T11:09:35.481874+00:00"}